      "content": "\"letting go of the fight\"... that's the only thing that sounds even remotely peaceful right now. it's like the only way to actually find rest is to just stop fighting the inevitable. like, why am i even stuck here clinging to a life that doesn't even belong to me anymore? it would just be so much easier if i could just... step out of it.",
